---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const categoryGuides = [
 ['shoes','Shoes','Browse sneakers, casual shoes and boots. Compare the seller’s sizing information, sole construction and available photos; a familiar size label does not ensure the same fit.'],
 ['hoodies-sweaters','Hoodies & sweaters','Explore pullovers, hoodies and knitwear. Check chest width, garment length, lining and fabric composition, and compare measurements with a garment you own.'],
 ['t-shirts','T-shirts','Look through short- and long-sleeved tops. Consider fabric weight, fit, sleeve length and print details, and check the selected color and size on the seller listing.'],
 ['jackets','Jackets & outerwear','Compare lightweight layers, padded jackets and coats. Review the shell, lining, closure, insulation description and size chart before choosing a style.'],
 ['pants-shorts','Pants & shorts','Find trousers, denim and shorts. Compare waist, rise, inseam and leg width, and check whether the seller’s measurements describe the garment or your body.'],
 ['headwear','Headwear','Browse caps, hats and other headwear. Check the stated circumference, adjustment method, fabric and construction; one-size labels may not fit everyone.'],
 ['ShortSets','Sets','Explore coordinated tops and bottoms. Confirm which pieces are included, whether the sizes are selected separately, and the measurements and materials of each piece.'],
 ['jersey','Jerseys','Compare sports and football jerseys by design, fit, printing and available customization. Check the listing for the exact version and any personalization terms.'],
 ['accessories','Accessories','Browse bags, belts and other accessories. Check dimensions, fastening, hardware and the seller’s material description rather than judging size from photos alone.'],
 ['electronics','Electronics','Compare device specifications, connector types, voltage and included accessories. Check shipping restrictions for batteries and confirm compatibility before purchase.']
];
const materials=[
 ['Cotton','Often used for T-shirts, hoodies and lining. Weight, weave and finishing affect how it feels; check the blend and care instructions for the actual item.'],
 ['Polyester','Common in sportswear, outerwear and blended fabrics. Its feel and performance vary by construction, so review the listing rather than assuming every fabric behaves alike.'],
 ['Nylon','Frequently used in lightweight shells, bags and some linings. A nylon label alone does not establish waterproofing or durability; check the seller’s specifications.'],
 ['Denim','A woven fabric commonly used for jeans and jackets, often cotton or a cotton blend. Check the blend, stretch, weight and wash instructions where available.'],
 ['Leather and synthetic alternatives','The appearance of a bag or shoe does not confirm its material. Check whether the listing specifies leather, coated fabric or a synthetic alternative and ask if it is unclear.'],
 ['Knit and fleece','Knits and fleece describe fabric construction or finish rather than a single fiber. Check the fiber blend, thickness and care details before comparing items.']
];
---
<Base title="Discover" page="discover"><section class="inner container"><div class="eyebrow" data-i="THE FINDS INDEX">THE FINDS INDEX</div><h1 data-i="Discover your next find">Discover your next find<span>.</span></h1><p class="lead" data-i="discoverintro">Explore product categories, learn about common materials and understand how to order through PikoBuy.</p><section class="discover-guide"><div class="eyebrow" data-i="discover-eyebrow">EXPLORE THE COLLECTION</div><h2 data-i="discover-categories">Discover by category</h2><p data-i="discover-category-intro">Choose a product type and compare its details before ordering.</p><div class="discover-copy-grid">{categoryGuides.map(([slug,title,description],index)=><article><h3><a href={`/categories/?category=${encodeURIComponent(slug)}`} data-i={`discover-cat-title-${index}`}>{title} →</a></h3><p data-i={`discover-cat-${index}`}>{description}</p></article>)}</div><h2 data-i="discover-materials">Understanding common materials</h2><p data-i="discover-material-intro">Materials vary by product. Always check the actual seller listing; catalogue photographs cannot establish fabric composition.</p><div class="discover-copy-grid">{materials.map(([title,description],index)=><article><h3 data-i={`discover-material-title-${index}`}>{title}</h3><p data-i={`discover-material-${index}`}>{description}</p></article>)}</div><h2 data-i="discover-buy">How to buy through PikoBuy</h2><ol class="buy-steps"><li><strong data-i="discover-step-title-0">Find and compare.</strong><span data-i="discover-step-0"> Search the catalogue or choose a category, then open a product and review the source listing, size, color and current price.</span></li><li><strong data-i="discover-step-title-1">Open the purchase page.</strong><span data-i="discover-step-1"> Use the PikoBuy purchase button where the source item ID is available, or check the original source link if it is not. Confirm the correct item and options before submitting your order.</span></li><li><strong data-i="discover-step-title-2">Review your order.</strong><span data-i="discover-step-2"> PikoBuy describes warehouse check-in and photo confirmation. Compare the available photos with your order and raise any issue before international shipping.</span></li><li><strong data-i="discover-step-title-3">Arrange delivery.</strong><span data-i="discover-step-3"> Choose an available shipping route and review the parcel quote. International shipping, taxes and other charges can be separate from the estimated product price.</span></li></ol><p><span data-i="discover-read">Read </span><a href="/articles/how-to-order-pikobuy/" data-i="discover-order-guide">the ordering guide</a><span data-i="discover-and"> and </span><a href="/faq/">FAQ</a><span data-i="discover-final"> for more detail. The final conditions and charges are determined by PikoBuy and the seller.</span></p></section></section></Base>
